Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; ============================================================
; ROTTR In-Game Settings — Optimized for Android / Mobile
; ============================================================
; These registry entries mirror ROTTR's settings.ini values
; via Wine registry for pre-configuration.
;
; Apply with: wine regedit patches/rottr-settings.reg

; Note: ROTTR primarily reads settings from its own .ini file.
; This reg file sets Wine-level overrides. The actual game
; settings should be configured via the setup-prefix.sh script
; which writes the game's config file directly.
